Cell["\<\
On a vertex-transitive graph every vertex is both centre and periphery, and \
the relative eccentricity is 0 everywhere, not 1 on the periphery.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"57a789e5-d202-42f8-a749-daa80316d76d"],

